{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51469","headline":"送友生下第出关 · 李郢","name":"送友生下第出关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天牓无名玉未焚，几飘凝泪泣青云。\n挈将孤剑家何在，叫断重阍帝不闻。\n花笑旅人惟赖酒，镜欺双鬓莫言文。\n糟床滴沥余声尽，典重裘又送君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}